{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:morrow:contracts:capabilities:v1.1",
  "title": "Morrow capability bodies version 1.1",
  "$comment": "Capability bodies that replace or add to urn:morrow:contracts:capabilities:v1, which stays byte-identical. A body resolves here first, then in v1. Every replacement is declared in changes.json and is not compatible with the v1 body in either direction.",
